        <dct:description xml:lang="en">Public aggregated data from the Administrative Register of Self-Consumption of Electrical Energy in Spain.</dct:description>
        <dct:description xml:lang="es">Datos agregados públicos del Registro Administrativo de Autoconsumo de Energía Eléctrica en España.</dct:description>
